Your only human connection is over a handheld radio, which you’ll use to speak with your supervisor Delilah about the things both of you are experiencing.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/firewatch', '["PlayStation 4", "Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.21, '2026-08-08 02:23:49', '2026-08-08 02:23:49');
